tes, including bacillus calmette-guerin organisms, and sensitize mice to mycobacterial antigens in vivo. <source>J. Exp. Med</source>. <volume>178</volume>:<fpage>479</fpage>&#x02013;488.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7688024</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><label>28</label><citation citation-type="journal">Labeur, M.S., B. Roters, B. Pers, A. Mehling, T.A. Luger, T. Schwarz, and, S. Grabbe. <year>1999</year>. Generation of tumor immunity by bone marrow-derived dendritic cells correlates with dendritic cell maturation stage. <source>J. Immunol</source>. <volume>162</volume>:<fpage>168</fpage>&#x02013;175.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9886383</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib29"><label>29</label><citation citation-type="journal">Katakai, T., T. Hara, M. Sugai, H. Gonda, Y. Nambu, E. Matsuda, Y. Agata, and A. Shimizu. <year>2002</year>. Chemokine-independent preference for T-helper-1 cells in transendothelial migration. <source>J. Biol. Chem</source>. <volume>277</volume>:<fpage>50948</fpage>&#x02013;50958.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12393898</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib30"><label>30</label><citation citation-type="journal">van Vliet, E., M. Melis, J.M. Foidart, and W. van Ewijk. <year>1986</year>. Reticular fibroblasts in peripheral lymphoid organs identified by a monoclonal antibody. <source>J. Histo. Cytochem</source>. <volume>34</volume>:<fpage>883</fpage>&#x02013;890.</citation></ref><ref id="bib31"><label>31</label><citation citation-type="journal">Schacht, V., M.I. Ramirez, Y.-K. Hong, S. Hirakawa, D. Feng, N. Harvey, M. Williams, A.M. Dvorak, H.F. Dvorak, G. Oliver, and M. Detmar. <year>2003</year>. T1&#x003b1;/podoplanin deficiency disrupts normal lymphatic vasculature formation and causes lymphedema. <source>EMBO. J</source>. <volume>22</volume>:<fpage>3546</fpage>&#x02013;3556.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12853470</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="journal">Banerji, S., J. Ni, S.-X. Wang, S. Claspe